PP-OCRv6_rec_small.onnx
=======================

The text-line recognition model that arm-transcode uses to turn image
subtitles (PGS) into text subtitles (.srt). It is built into the image; ARM
never downloads a model at run time.

  File     PP-OCRv6_rec_small.onnx (ONNX, with its character list in the model metadata)
